<title>USA: Top U.S. general to visit Bosnia.</title>
<headline>Top U.S. general to visit Bosnia.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Army Gen. John Shalikashvili, the Pentagon's top military officer, will visit Bosnia next Wednesday for talks with military peacekeeping commanders and other officials, the Defence Department said on Friday.</p>
<p>Shalikashvili, chairman of the U.S. military Joint Chiefs of Staff, will leave Washington this Sunday for Portugal to participate in NATO Military Committee meetings before travelling from Lisbon to Bosnia on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The announcement said he planned to hold a news conference in Sarajevo on Wednesday before leaving for Washington that night.</p>
